<http://ops-sys.local/ontology#decision/research.treat-the-chatgpt-research-brief-research-brief-00-original-brief-md-as-a-scope> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#rationale> "The brief is good but asks for ~13 deliverables, 30 questions and 25+ prospects; breadth would dilute evidence quality. The founder decision matters more than coverage." <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#graph/ws/energy> .
<http://ops-sys.local/ontology#decision/research.treat-the-chatgpt-research-brief-research-brief-00-original-brief-md-as-a-scope> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#name> "Treat the ChatGPT research brief (research/brief/00_original_brief.md) as a scope document, not a template to answer line by line. Prioritise the primary decision (1-2 first wedges from Munich) and depth on top wedges over 13 full deliverables." <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#graph/ws/energy> .
